---
import StaffNavigation from '../../../components/StaffNavigation.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import '../../../styles/admin.css';
import '../../../styles/organizer-tasks.css';
---
<SiteLayout title="今日待办｜ARTDiCO HOST" description="筹备团队私有待办、邀请进度与展位资料核对。">
  <div class="ah-admin tasks-app">
    <header class="ah-admin-header"><a class="ah-admin-brand" href="/admin/">ARTDiCO <span>HOST / TODAY</span></a><nav aria-label="公开活动页面"><a class="ah-admin-back" href="https://artdico.host">查看活动页面 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></header>
    <main class="ah-admin-main" id="main-content">
      <div class="ah-admin-environment"><span class="ah-admin-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>内部工作区</p></div>
      <p class="ah-admin-status" data-tasks-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="ah-admin-alert" data-tasks-error role="alert" hidden></p>
      <section class="ah-admin-login-card" data-tasks-login-panel><h1>今日待办</h1><p class="ah-admin-intro">登录后查看跟进事项与现场安排。</p><form method="post" data-tasks-login><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="tasks-user">用户名或邮箱</label><input id="tasks-user" name="username" autocomplete="username" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" required maxlength="160" /></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="tasks-password">密码</label><input id="tasks-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="1024" /></div><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit" data-tasks-login-submit disabled>登录</button></form><noscript><p>请启用 JavaScript。</p></noscript></section>
      <section class="ah-admin-workspace-layout" data-tasks-workspace hidden>
        <StaffNavigation current="tasks" />
        <div class="ah-admin-workspace-content">
        <div class="ah-admin-page-heading"><div><h1>今日待办</h1></div><div class="tasks-account"><span data-tasks-user></span><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-tasks-refresh>刷新进度</button><button class="ah-admin-text-button" type="button" data-tasks-logout>退出登录</button></div></div>
        <div class="tasks-metrics" data-tasks-metrics aria-label="全部名单的进度概况"></div>
        <details class="ah-admin-small"><summary>统计说明</summary><p>按人去重，排除拒绝联系或出席者。人工发出、服务商接受与本人回复分开记录；服务商接受不代表送达。</p></details>
        <p class="tasks-caution" data-tasks-availability hidden></p>
        <section class="ah-admin-panel tasks-panel" aria-labelledby="tasks-list-title"><div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><h2 id="tasks-list-title">接下来要做的事</h2><p>选择负责人或事项，继续跟进。</p></div></div>
          <form class="tasks-filters" data-tasks-filters><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="tasks-owner">负责同事 / 展位负责人</label><select id="tasks-owner" name="owner" data-tasks-owner><option value="">全部负责人</option><option value="__unassigned">尚未分配负责人</option></select></div><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="tasks-kind">待办类型</label><select id="tasks-kind" name="kind" data-tasks-kind><option value="">全部待办</option></select></div><button class="ah-admin-button ah-admin-primary" type="submit">应用筛选</button><button class="ah-admin-button" type="reset">清除筛选</button></form>
          <div class="tasks-quick-filters" data-tasks-quick aria-label="按待办类型查看"></div><p class="tasks-result" data-tasks-result role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <ul class="tasks-list" data-tasks-list></ul><p class="ah-admin-empty" data-tasks-empty hidden>当前没有待办，可清除筛选查看全部。</p>
          <div class="tasks-pagination"><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-tasks-first hidden>返回第一页</button><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-tasks-next hidden>查看下一页</button></div>
        </section><p class="ah-admin-small" data-tasks-meta></p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main><footer class="ah-admin-footer"><span>ARTDiCO HOST</span><a href="/admin/contacts/">人员与邀约 →</a></footer>
  </div>
  <script>import '../../../scripts/organizer-tasks.mjs';</script>
</SiteLayout>
